---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import Button from '../Button.astro';
import surfImage from '../../assets/surf.jpg';
---

<section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-navy-deep py-32 text-pearl md:py-44 lg:py-56">
  <div class="absolute inset-0">
    <Image
      src={surfImage}
      alt="Mark Stephens surfing inside the barrel of a breaking wave in Hawaii"
      widths={[828, 960]}
      sizes="100vw"
      class="h-full w-full object-cover"
    />
    <div class="scrim-left absolute inset-0" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  </div>

  <figure class="relative z-10 mx-auto w-full max-w-[90rem] px-6 md:px-10 lg:px-16" data-reveal>
    <div class="max-w-4xl">
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-rule mb-8 text-pearl/70">From the waters of Hawaii to the hills of New Hampshire</p>
      <blockquote class="display text-[clamp(1.75rem,3.6vw,3rem)] leading-[1.16]" data-scroll-text>
        Surfing taught me patience, balance, and respect for forces larger than myself. In many ways, those same
        lessons guide how I care for the places and properties entrusted to me today.
      </blockquote>
      <figcaption class="eyebrow mt-10 text-pearl/50">Mark Stephens</figcaption>
      <p class="mt-10 max-w-2xl text-[0.9375rem] leading-relaxed text-pearl/75">
        The waters of Hawaii shaped how I work; today that same care serves homes and estates across the Upper
        Valley of New Hampshire and Vermont.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-10">
        <Button href="#contact" variant="outline-light">Request Private Service</Button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </figure>
</section>
